{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 2740 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E6", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 81284031505 identifies CENEXI (FEI 3007250542) as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 924508 of that plant ended 2015-04-28 and was classified OAI with nine observations including SOPs not followed and batches formulated to less than 100%.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the shortage on 2022-08-23, and the most recent inspection (1245208) ended 2022-10-26, classified VAI, 64 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 50 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 31 units at 4.4 per day (7 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 65 units at 4.3 per day (15 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-ranked option is to transfer 4 units from Corvale General to Corvale East; Corvale General can spare 4 while keeping two weeks and Corvale East would reach 8 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether Sagent Pharmaceuticals is a viable alternate source, as it is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
